    "created_at": "2018-11-28T16:15:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-28T16:15:52Z",
    "body": "I don't understand the objection here; this same objection applies to anything at all that you could ever send over a MessageChannel, and we have a lot of things like that.\r\n\r\nMaybe this is an objection to MessageChannel in general, and implementers are asking about whether they can remove their MessageChannel implementations and/or freeze them in time and never make them better as a \"deprecated\" feature? That would be unfortunate, and feels like a violation of the priority of constituencies.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
