    "created_at": "2018-11-28T16:22:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-28T16:22:14Z",
    "body": "Chromium supports using MessageChannel with SharedArrayBuffer. It's not fully spec compliant, but the basic behavior as described in that bug (A -> B -> C, A and C are same process) is supported.",
