    "created_at": "2018-11-29T08:30:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-29T08:30:24Z",
    "body": "@domenic, SAB is unusual in that it cannot be copied even in principle - there is no representation for it other than \"address X in process P\".  Are there other values that can be sent on a channel that are like that?\r\n\r\nAnyway, interesting to hear that Chromium now supports this behavior.",
